{"page":136,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:69","surah":6,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ يَتَّقُونَ مِنْ حِسَابِهِم مِّن شَىْءٍ وَلَـٰكِن ذِكْرَىٰ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The righteous are not in any way held accountable for the wrongdoers; their only duty is to remind them, so that they may be mindful of God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"(is) on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"fear (Allah)","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":6,"ar":"حِسَابِهِم","en_gloss":"their account","transliteration":"ḥisābihim","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذِكْرَىٰ","en_gloss":"(for) reminder","transliteration":"dhik'rā","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"fear (Allah)","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"6:69"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٦٩","en_gloss":"(69)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:69"}]},{"verse_key":"6:70","surah":6,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"وَذَرِ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّخَذُوا۟ دِينَهُمْ لَعِبًا وَلَهْوًا وَغَرَّتْهُمُ ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ وَذَكِّرْ بِهِۦٓ أَن تُبْسَلَ نَفْسٌۢ بِمَا كَسَبَتْ لَيْسَ لَهَا مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ وَلِىٌّ وَلَا شَفِيعٌ وَإِن تَعْدِلْ كُلَّ عَدْلٍ لَّا يُؤْخَذْ مِنْهَآ ۗ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُبْسِلُوا۟ بِمَا كَسَبُوا۟ ۖ لَهُمْ شَرَابٌ مِّنْ حَمِيمٍ وَعَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌۢ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْفُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Leave to themselves those who take their religion for a mere game and distraction and are deceived by the life of this world, but continue to remind them with the [Quran], lest any soul be damned by what it has done- it will have no one to protect it from God and no one to intercede; whatever ransom it may offer will not be accepted. Such are those who are damned by their own actions: they will have boil-ing water to drink and a painful punishment, because they used to defy [God].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَذَرِ","en_gloss":"And leave","transliteration":"wadhari","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","en_gloss":"take","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دِينَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their religion","transliteration":"dīnahum","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَعِبًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a play","transliteration":"laʿiban","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَهْوًۭا","en_gloss":"and amusement","transliteration":"walahwan","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَغَرَّتْهُمُ","en_gloss":"and deluded them","transliteration":"wagharrathumu","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَذَكِّرْ","en_gloss":"But remind","transliteration":"wadhakkir","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُبْسَلَ","en_gloss":"is given up to destruction","transliteration":"tub'sala","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نَفْسٌۢ","en_gloss":"a soul","transliteration":"nafsun","verse_key":"6:70"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","translitera