,{"pos":2,"ar":"أَقِيمُوا۟","en_gloss":"establish","transliteration":"aqīmū","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the prayer","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and fear Him","transliteration":"wa-ittaqūhu","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","en_gloss":"(is) the One","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تُحْشَرُونَ","en_gloss":"you will be gathered","transliteration":"tuḥ'sharūna","verse_key":"6:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٧٢","en_gloss":"(72)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:72"}]},{"verse_key":"6:73","surah":6,"ayah":73,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ وَيَوْمَ يَقُولُ كُن فَيَكُونُ ۚ قَوْلُهُ ٱلْحَقُّ ۚ وَلَهُ ٱلْمُلْكُ يَوْمَ يُنفَخُ فِى ٱلصُّورِ ۚ عَـٰلِمُ ٱلْغَيْبِ وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْحَكِيمُ ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is He who created the heavens and the earth for a true purpose. On the Day when He says, ‘Be,’ it will be: His word is the truth. All control on the Day the Trumpet is blown belongs to Him. He knows the seen and the unseen: He is the All Wise, the All Aware.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And (it is) He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"6:73"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"6:73"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"6:73"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"6:73"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"6:73"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","en_gloss":"in truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"6:73"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the